    {
      "id": "npc_1789478185903",
      "name": "可比布·莱恩特",
      "gender": "不详",
      "identity": "？？？",
      "portrait": "AIT20260915202256XSP71YC8-512x768-pixels,-full-body-standing-portr-1.png",
      "avatar": "",
      "moods": [],
      "graph": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "s",
            "type": "start",
            "x": 60,
            "y": 180
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789483646009",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 348.27528399151106,
            "y": 186.54536507947842,
            "text": "額······人類，你好。"
          },
          {
            "id": "c1789483744419",
            "type": "choice",
            "x": 617.2431513348641,
            "y": 192.37560582877487,
            "text": "",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "o1",
                "text": "你看起来好奇怪",
                "flag": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "o2",
                "text": "你看起来真美！",
                "flag": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789483776045",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 890.5423494891265,
            "y": 82.14453206290781,
            "text": "你看錯了，我只是一個普通的人類，和你們一樣"
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789483778307",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 847.7403078824689,
            "y": 302.9613912034959,
            "text": "真的嗎？真讓我沒想到···謝謝？"
          },
          {
            "id": "c1789483981618",
            "type": "choice",
            "x": 1174.9490488586432,
            "y": 77.20657824318468,
            "text": "",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "o1",
                "text": "你是一个外星人。",
                "flag": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "o2",
                "text": "嗯···应该是我看错了",
                "flag": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "c1789483982891",
            "type": "choice",
            "x": 1105.6667364203167,
            "y": 332.73855449071675,
            "text": "",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "o1",
                "text": "我只是随便说说",
                "flag": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "o2",
                "text": "是真的。",
                "flag": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789484094674",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 1394.7614756637722,
            "y": 225.09354112184803,
            "text": "额……"
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789484120234",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 1879.2831172048104,
            "y": 81.9490467935147,
            "text": "那是我的飞船，但我不小心坠毁了。现在我的确很无助，如果你能帮我做点什么，我可以给你一件宝贝"
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789484120404",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 887.4907668197511,
            "y": 510.0856552737115,
            "text": "我保证事后马上给你"
          },
          {
            "id": "c1789484190587",
            "type": "choice",
            "x": 40.28464743526456,
            "y": 560.5571652411568,
            "text": "",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "o1",
                "text": "我可以帮你修",
                "flag": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "o2",
                "text": "把你的宝贝给我！！",
                "flag": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "o1789484572939",
                "text": "算了，我还有别的事要做",
                "flag": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p1789484206819",
            "type": "player",
            "x": 637.8398007738792,
            "y": 481.00406504544003,
            "text": "然后你会给我这个“宝贝”，对吧？"
          },
          {
            "id": "p1789484209834",
            "type": "player",
            "x": 1616.6728795589408,
            "y": 83.74141842750089,
            "text": "你身后那个看起来像大盘子的是什么东西？"
          },
          {
            "id": "a1789484409261",
            "type": "accept",
            "x": 341.6584401450982,
            "y": 507.5597323609352,
            "text": "",
            "questId": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789484479791",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 1179.006522737862,
            "y": 502.55315889531335,
            "text": "我需要四个钉子、三个铁板，请带来给我。"
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789484534571",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 301.7328285471049,
            "y": 639.7346184724998,
            "text": "不！你想抢劫我？"
          },
          {
            "id": "c1789484561099",
            "type": "choice",
            "x": 566.7273857850892,
            "y": 751.3937458349576,
            "text": "",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "o1",
                "text": "废话少说！！！",
                "flag": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "o2",
                "text": "我只是开玩笑",
                "flag": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "n1789484588524",
            "type": "npc",
            "x": 271.38197160456104,
            "y": 860.530333409627,
            "text": "好吧"
          },
          {
